{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471934",
      "title": "Re-triggering Animations via Keys",
      "sourceHash": "a624325c77951b9f57ddcfe84dd8fd5697a4b242325dd48c4893967fe565deb1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "As a next and almost final step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 6.57,
          "en": "in this section here, I now wanna show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.57,
          "end": 11.57,
          "en": "how you can re-trigger an animation after it already played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "And for that, let's say that we wanna bump those badges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 18.723,
          "en": "whenever the number in those badges changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.56,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "So if I move this item from the Completed list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "to the Failed list, this Failed and this Completed badge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 28.623,
          "en": "should bounce because they both changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 33.97,
          "en": "Now, to achieve this, we can go to this Badge component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.19,
          "end": 39.36,
          "en": "and in there we can import motion from Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 41.373,
          "en": "as we did it multiple times already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.48,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "To convert this span from a span to a motion span.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "Of course, also for the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "And with that we can add a little animation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "that should be played whenever this element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "appears on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "And we could do this with initial and animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "as we did it multiple times before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "or actually with just animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "since we can also set key frames to define multiple steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 72,
          "en": "we wanna go through without defining initial.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "And that's simply an alternative approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 75.483,
          "en": "I'm showing to you here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.81,
          "en": "So here we could then animate the scale,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "so the size of this span,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 83.61,
          "en": "and then set a couple of key frames",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 88.047,
          "en": "so that we start at the initial size but then we go to 1.2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.4,
          "end": 93.483,
          "en": "so to a 20% bigger size, and then back to 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 97.71000000000001,
          "en": "And I will also add the transition prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.71000000000001,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "to all the control the duration of this animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 104.40299999999999,
          "en": "and set this to 0.3, so to 300 milliseconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "With that, if we save that, you will see those badges bump",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "whenever we reload the page, but not thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "If I move items around, those badges are not bumping,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "and why would they?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 122.82,
          "en": "This animation here is only played once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 124.833,
          "en": "when the element first appears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.12,
          "end": 129.27,
          "en": "But that's exactly what this lecture is about now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.27,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "because you can actually restart this animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "you can reset this component so to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 138.573,
          "en": "and kind of make React think that it just appeared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "And you can easily do that from inside ChallengeTabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "which is where I'm using this Badge component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 148.863,
          "en": "by adding a key to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.97,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "Now in React, you mostly know this key from lists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 157.65,
          "en": "Whenever you map through items to output a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.65,
          "end": 160.02,
          "en": "you should add a key to every item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.02,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "That's what you learned in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 164.28300000000002,
          "en": "and what you should know as a React developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.78,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "In this section you also learned that with Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 172.77,
          "en": "you also need a key if you have an animate presence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 174.663,
          "en": "with multiple child items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.22,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "But in React, even if you're not using Framer Motion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 182.493,
          "en": "keys also have another purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.45,
          "end": 185.82,
          "en": "When you add them on an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.82,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "and you then change the value that's assigned to the key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 192.24,
          "en": "For example, because of some state change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.24,
          "end": 196.26,
          "en": "React will basically destroy the old component instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 198.75,
          "en": "and render a new one instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.75,
          "end": 203.31,
          "en": "So you can add that key prop to any component of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.31,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "and change that value then to get React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 208.713,
          "en": "to recreate that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.82,
          "end": 212.76,
          "en": "And that will reset any internal state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.76,
          "end": 214.41,
          "en": "stored in that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.41,
          "end": 219.09,
          "en": "and also therefore re-trigger any entry animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.09,
          "end": 220.233,
          "en": "that should be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.06,
          "end": 224.46,
          "en": "And therefore, here we can add a key prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.46,
          "end": 228.723,
          "en": "to the Badge component and set this to badgeCaption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 233.43,
          "en": "And the badgeCaption will be the number of items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.43,
          "end": 235.86,
          "en": "in the list to which the badge belongs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 235.86,
          "end": 239.253,
          "en": "and it will change whenever that number of items changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.15,
          "end": 242.34,
          "en": "Therefore, the key will change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.34,
          "end": 245.01,
          "en": "whenever the number of items in a list changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.01,
          "end": 247.05,
          "en": "and the badge will be recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.05,
          "end": 249.513,
          "en": "and the entry animation will be played again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 254.31,
          "en": "That's how we're using this key to get Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.31,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "to play that animation again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 259.95,
          "en": "And therefore, now with that key added on the badge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 259.95,
          "end": 261.99,
          "en": "if you watch those badges now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.99,
          "end": 264.27,
          "en": "if I click Mark as failed here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.27,
          "end": 268.293,
          "en": "you see the Completed and the Failed badge bumped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 269.52,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "Let's do it again. Here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 275.22,
          "en": "And we can of course, do the same in the opposite direction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.24,
          "end": 279.24,
          "en": "And that's another very useful thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 281.07,
          "en": "and pattern to be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.07,
          "end": 284.4,
          "en": "Setting the key and setting it to a different value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.4,
          "end": 286.44,
          "en": "will recreate the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.44,
          "end": 290.433,
          "en": "and can therefore be used to rerun entry animations.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}